OL,3,GNEWSAThe cave which may have been home
OL,4,Ato a white witch
OL,5,
OL,6,FHidden in a sandstone cliff beside a
OL,7,Friver in Surrey lies a small cave that
OL,8,Fhas inspired rumours, legends and
OL,9,Fghostly tales for centuries.
OL,11,FKnown as Mother Ludlam's Cave, the site
OL,12,Fbeside the River Wey in Moor Park near
OL,13,FFarnham combines documented medieval
OL,14,Fhistory with one of the county's
OL,15,Fbest-known folk legends.
OL,17,FAccording to local folklore, Mother
OL,18,FLudlam was a benevolent white witch who
OL,19,Flived in the cave and helped her
OL,20,Fneighbours.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
